{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "76bdb8654afc4dff704c2b241e90ee71606a04746da392265428263d218c2cc5", "ja": "うーん、エントランスはやりすぎかな～……。\nやっぱり、廊下がいいかな～？", "zh": "嗯～挂在大厅好像太高调了……\n果然该挂在走廊吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3ad6b805d8a30348cf319c25f6fd71224bfc0deec485335679396479f269b803", "ja": "可奈、何を悩んでるんだ？\nそれは……この前描いた絵か。", "zh": "可奈，你在烦恼什么？\n那是……你之前画的画吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "31e79bd995e992e8a4a8f8edeec394aca6c194bef159edf0c374225491eb7d7a", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん♪\nはいっ、そうなんです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生♪\n是的，正是如此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "bad239dc7a38da008b5c67260c1b2ee2c6d6a080ed5e5cbce0dce2f3dcadf52c", "ja": "えへへへへ……実はこの絵を、\n劇場に飾ったらどうか～って、美咲さんが！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿嘿……其实是美咲建议我\n把这幅画挂在剧场当装饰啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4672d3e1a60a337b15ef26cbf51c423713364705aa9f2bbdd0553b2582c99fce", "ja": "それはいいアイディアだな！\n明日の公演には、可奈も出るし……。", "zh": "那真是好主意呢！\n而且明天的公演，可奈也会出场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "fe78826a0ac7efb0ba42d61f33e5c6b3abf42f5078eab779c734661ba69f2ee5", "ja": "はいっ！　だからファンの人達も、喜んでくれるんじゃ\nないかな～って。喜んでくれるといいな～♪", "zh": "是啊！不知道这样粉丝们会不会开心～\n希望他们会开心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2bb58259cb3bbe8c4fdad5e4610cf1e69e9f27e4b45c71ace7d4559169253ecd", "ja": "そうだな。それに、いい絵だから、\n倉庫に眠らせておくのはもったいない。", "zh": "是啊。而且这幅画画得很棒，\n只让它沉睡在仓库里也很浪费。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "3ee0859108f17fac6efdd447be874f15309cbe2a4ed8e61e2da9e54050f7e883", "ja": "そ、そんな～！　そんなに上手じゃないと思うんです\nけど……でもでも、すっごく嬉しいですっ！", "zh": "没、没有啦～！也没那么棒……\n不过不过，我很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "d5e68cdee355e6641b610a7587396f0f7b1883099f91316318f0f6529309a92b", "ja": "可奈の絵が～、えが～、笑顔をつくる～♪\nみんなの笑顔で～、可奈も笑顔に～♪", "zh": "可奈的画～画～带来笑容～♪\n大家的笑容～让可奈也笑了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "8837da8b13661f073be6bd8bce04843497a74114506f21646d16dc6ed998f51a", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　せっかくだから、私が描いた\n{$P$}さんの絵も飾りませんか！？", "zh": "啊，对了！机会难得，要不要把我画的\n{$P$}先生肖像也拿出来装饰呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0629aa97158828f58c8dec46a6b80bed7ef54515ff76d328723a37267e490c43", "ja": "い、いや、あっちはいいよ！\nお客さんには誰かわからないだろうし……！", "zh": "不、不用，那就不必了！\n观众们看了也不知道是谁吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0053_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "8b575fa1310913d5d3c037a000a63eacf238a2d8ad92c1efe52943fcece4a68d", "ja": "え～、そうですか？　よく描けたと思うんだけどな～。\nそれじゃ、また今度にしますね！", "zh": "咦～是吗？我觉得画得很不错耶～\n那就下次再说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
